{"id":73596,"date":"2026-11-09T15:28:40","date_gmt":"2026-11-09T15:28:40","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=73596"},"modified":"2026-11-09T16:33:06","modified_gmt":"2026-11-09T15:33:06","slug":"trilhos-do-paleozoico","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-do-paleozoico\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilhos do Paleoz\u00f3ico 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilhos do Paleoz\u00f3ico 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os <strong>Trilhos do Paleoz\u00f3ico 2027<\/strong> (14\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realizam-se no domingo, <strong>14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Valongo<\/strong>, distrito do <strong>Porto<\/strong>. Com partida e chegada centralizadas no emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Largo do Centen\u00e1rio<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o de Valongo, o evento desafia os atletas a percorrer os trilhos t\u00e9cnicos e cristas quartz\u00edticas das <strong>Serras de Santa Justa e de Pias<\/strong>, integrando o <strong>Parque Paleoz\u00f3ico de Valongo<\/strong> e o Centro de Trail municipal.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos atravessam um patrim\u00f3nio geol\u00f3gico e mineiro milenar, passando pela pitoresca <strong>Aldeia de Couce<\/strong>, pelos vales do rio Ferreira, por Pias e pela Ponte de S\u00e3o Sim\u00e3o. A oferta competitiva e de lazer desdobra-se em quatro provas com partidas faseadas: o exigente <strong>Trail Ultra de 48 km<\/strong> (2.600 m D+, Grau 3 ATRP\/ITRA, partida \u00e0s 08:00), o <strong>Trail Sprint de 23 km<\/strong> (1.150 m D+, Grau 2 ATRP\/ITRA, \u00e0s 09:00), o <strong>Mini Trail \/ Trail Jovem de 12 km<\/strong> (300 m D+, \u00e0s 09:30) e a <strong>Caminhada do Paleoz\u00f3ico de 12 km<\/strong> (\u00e0s 09:35), pontuando as dist\u00e2ncias de 12 km e 23 km tamb\u00e9m para o <strong>Circuito Trilhos de Valongo<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo <strong>Grupo Dram\u00e1tico e Recreativo da Retorta<\/strong> em coorganiza\u00e7\u00e3o com a <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Valongo<\/strong>, a prova garante secretariado na Junta de Freguesia de Valongo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, medalha de finisher e banhos nas Piscinas de Valongo, premiando ainda as primeiras 900 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es pagas com uma forma tradicional da <strong>A Metal\u00fargica Bakeware<\/strong>. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Largo do Centen\u00e1rio, Valongo, Porto<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Trail Ultra 48 km, Trail Sprint 23 km, Mini Trail 12 km e Caminhada 12 km<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Grupo Dram\u00e1tico e Recreativo da Retorta<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Corte)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10h00 geral (48 km: 5h em Pias km 25 e 8h na Ponte de S\u00e3o Sim\u00e3o km 39) | 5h00 (Caminhada)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5