"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (04\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Mini Trail \/ Trail Jovem \u2013 12 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:30 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 300m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Promo (-5%):<\/strong> 12.35 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (10\/11 a 16\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (17\/11\/2026 a 03\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (04\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada do Paleoz\u00f3ico \u2013 12 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 14 de Mar\u00e7o de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:35 \u2022 \u26f0\ufe0f 300m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Promo (-5%):<\/strong> 11.40 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (10\/11 a 16\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (17\/11\/2026 a 03\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 13.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (04\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, local de partida e hor\u00e1rios dos Trilhos do Paleoz\u00f3ico 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 14\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o dos Trilhos do Paleoz\u00f3ico realiza-se no domingo, 14 de mar\u00e7o de 2027, com partida e chegada no Largo do Centen\u00e1rio, no centro de Valongo. O Trail Ultra 48 km parte \u00e0s 08:00, o Trail Sprint 23 km \u00e0s 09:00, o Mini Trail 12 km \u00e0s 09:30 e a Caminhada 12 km \u00e0s 09:35. O secretariado funciona na Junta de Freguesia de Valongo no s\u00e1bado (14:30\u201318:00) e no domingo (06:30\u201309:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis positivos e graus ATRP\/ITRA?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento compreende quatro dist\u00e2ncias nas serras de Santa Justa e Pias: Trail Ultra 48 km (~2.600 m D+, TU-M Grau 3 ATRP\/ITRA), Trail Sprint 23 km (~1.150 m D+, TL Grau 2 ATRP\/ITRA), Mini Trail \/ Trail Jovem 12 km (~300 m D+, TC Grau 2 ATRP\/ITRA, aberto a maiores de 15 anos) e Caminhada do Paleoz\u00f3ico 12 km (n\u00e3o competitiva).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dos Trilhos do Paleoz\u00f3ico 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Ap\u00f3s a fase promocional de 10 a 16 de novembro de 2026 (-5% sobre a 1\u00aa fase), os valores na 1\u00aa Fase (17\/11\/2026 a 03\/01\/2027) s\u00e3o: 45 \u20ac (48 km), 22 \u20ac (23 km), 13 \u20ac (Mini Trail 12 km) e 12 \u20ac (Caminhada 12 km). Na 2\u00aa Fase (04\/01 a 28\/02\/2027), os pre\u00e7os passam para 48 \u20ac (48 km), 25 \u20ac (23 km), 15 \u20ac (Mini Trail 12 km) e 13 \u20ac (Caminhada 12 km). As primeiras 900 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es pagas recebem ainda uma forma para bolos da A Metal\u00fargica Bakeware.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os tempos limite, barreiras hor\u00e1rias e material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite geral \u00e9 de 10 horas (5 horas para a Caminhada). No Trail Ultra 48 km existem duas barreiras hor\u00e1rias: 5 horas no Abastecimento de Pias (~km 25) e 8 horas na Ponte de S\u00e3o Sim\u00e3o (~km 39). \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica e recipiente\/reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos de Aldeia de Couce, Pias e Bustelo).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o evento e onde funcionam os banhos e resultados?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pelo Grupo Dram\u00e1tico e Recreativo da Retorta em parceria com a C\u00e2mara Municipal de Valongo. Os atletas t\u00eam acesso aos balne\u00e1rios das Piscinas de Valongo (~500 metros da meta) entre as 11:30 e as 18:00, e todas as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais poder\u00e3o ser consultadas no portal Portugal Running.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilhos do Paleoz\u00f3ico 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"endDate\": \"2027-03-14\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Largo do Centen\u00e1rio, Valongo\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Valongo\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 14\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o dos Trilhos do Paleoz\u00f3ico 2027 decorre a 14 de mar\u00e7o nas serras de Valongo (48 km, 23 km e 12 km). Consulta o regulamento oficial e inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/trilhos-do-paleozoico-2027.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Ultra \u2013 48 km\", \"price\": \"45.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trilhos-do-paleozoico-2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Sprint \u2013 23 km\", \"price\": \"22.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/trilhos-do-paleozoico-2027\", \"validFrom\": \"2027-01-01\"}, {\